@startuml State Diagram for Color Sensor with Neural Network

[*] --> Power_Init

Power_Init : Power color sensor and initialize system
Power_Init --> Read_Sensor

Read_Sensor : Read live color sensor values
Read_Sensor --> NN_Predict

NN_Predict : Run NN and predict object type
NN_Predict --> Command_Switch

Command_Switch : Command physical switch
Command_Switch --> Read_Sensor

@enduml
